# The harness's drivers (tests/oracle/oracle.py runs them): the checks of
# the repo's .clang-tidy, without those that only meet a driver's idioms.
#   bugprone-exception-escape  an exception out of main ends the driver
#       with a message and a failing exit code, which the harness reports
#       as the run's failure
#   bugprone-unchecked-string-to-number-conversion  atoi reads the
#       arguments the harness passes, whose form the harness fixes
#   performance-*  a driver is not a hot path (its callbacks take an
#       Assembly by value as AssemblyCallback hands it over)
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-exception-escape,
  -bugprone-unchecked-string-to-number-conversion,
  -performance-*
...
